descendants of Holocaust survivors

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:06.400
and how the descendants
of Holocaust survivors

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:09.343
have so much PTSD and anxiety and trauma

00:20:09.343 --> 00:20:11.320
and I'm like y'all didn't do that study

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:12.650
on nobody else in America?

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.047
Like you don't think African
Americans go through that?

00:20:14.047 --> 00:20:16.490
You think think Native
Americans don't go through that?

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:17.754
So it's just like for me is just like,

00:20:17.754 --> 00:20:19.630
why not go do the work?

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:23.140
Like I work out three, four
times a week physically.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:25.109
