00:21:41.364 --> 00:21:43.593
I get really nervous.

00:21:43.593 --> 00:21:45.543
I start shaking, my lips start shaking,

00:21:45.543 --> 00:21:47.210
my hands start shaking,

00:21:47.210 --> 00:21:50.280
and I don't want them to just you know,

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.700
just look at my work and be like okay,

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.001
yeah she does really good work,

00:21:53.001 --> 00:21:55.982
but at the same time I'm just so anxious,

00:21:55.982 --> 00:21:59.510
I'm just so nervous like I
want them to take me seriously.

00:21:59.510 --> 00:22:01.580
So what do you guys suggest?

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:02.423
