anxiety and irrational anxiety.

00:22:08.630 --> 00:22:12.162
so for you to be about to close big deals

00:22:12.162 --> 00:22:14.430
and you're trying to sell
something to somebody,

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:16.050
you should have a little
bit of anxiousness

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:16.883
when it comes to that.

00:22:16.883 --> 00:22:18.630
Like it's like me when I
approach the radio every day

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:20.400
or I go onstage to present something

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:22.800
like I know I'm doing
this to millions of people

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:25.550
so I'm gonna feel something in my stomach,

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:27.240
but what you have to do with that fear,

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:28.650
I got an acronym for fear

00:22:28.650 --> 00:22:30.500
and it's face everything and rise

00:22:30.500 --> 00:22:32.010
or fear everything and run.

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:34.500
It sounds like right now you're
being afraid of everything

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:36.920
and running, but you just
need to rise to the moment

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:39.600
in those occasions
because you're supposed to

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:41.330
get goosebumps when you're
about to close a deal

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:42.590
or you're trying to close a deal.

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:45.070
You're supposed to feel
like you got to take a shit,

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:46.056
you know I mean?

00:22:46.056 --> 00:22:47.760
You're supposed to feel
something in your stomach,

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:49.760
so I just think that's rational anxiety.

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.132
I don't think it's
anything wrong with that,

00:22:51.132 --> 00:22:52.610
you just got to use that fear as fuel.

00:22:52.610 --> 00:22:53.730
- The other place that I think is

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:56.250
an interesting place to
go is, a couple things,

00:22:56.250 --> 00:23:00.599
